# WWW-001 — Frozen UI (noirframe.art)

Navigation labels, menu items, section titles (P0), system layout labels (P1), and button captions like BACK TO MENU are **brand assets**. They must never be translated, localized, auto-rewritten, or modified by browser translation. Treat them as **immutable UI identifiers**.

**P2 Content** (bios, prices, blog posts, contact data, language list values) and **P3 Marketing** (tagline, CTA, subtitles, footers) **are editable** via JSON/NFST.

## Sources

- P0/P1 strings: `website/frozen-ui.js` → rendered in `script.js` (JSON cannot override at render time for P0/P1)
- P3 defaults: `MARKETING_DEFAULTS` in `frozen-ui.js` — not frozen
- Publish guards: NFST `publisher/frozen_ui.rs` blocks P0/P1 JSON mutations on Publish Live

## Do not

- Move section H1 or nav labels into editable JSON without updating guards
- Freeze taglines, CTAs, or marketing copy (P3)
- Edit protected CSS selectors in `WWW-001A_Protected_Selectors.md` without WWW-002 snapshots

## Layout

NFST must not change geometry. See `WWW-001A_Protected_Selectors.md` and `WWW-002_Layout_Freeze.md`.

See `WWW-001_UI_Freeze_v1.md`.
